Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:18.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Kartal waltzes into the Wuhan final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡尔塔尔闯进了武汉决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:22.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her big moment in a 1000 arrives.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的一千赛高光时刻来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An outstanding victory.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场了不起的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.18,TL,,0,0,0,,排名第{\fs78}170{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.22,TL,,0,0,0,,这个数字说的不是她的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.15,TL,,0,0,0,,是她停下来的那半年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:35.72,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}17{\fs68}号 武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.54,TL,,0,0,0,,卡尔塔尔连赢两个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:39.34,TL,,0,0,0,,淘汰了奥斯塔彭科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:42.16,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月前 她因为背伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.09,TL,,0,0,0,,她在布莱顿长大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:49.65,TL,,0,0,0,,从小到大 她最常碰到的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.33,TL,,0,0,0,,叫拉杜卡努
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:55.57,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2011{\fs68}年 英国{\fs78}10{\fs68}岁以下组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:56.52,TL,,0,0,0,,两个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.82,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了一个停不下来的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:00.91,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 一个拿了美网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:03.05,TL,,0,0,0,,一个还在一场一场地打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:09.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Emma and I, we grew up playing each other,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和艾玛从小就是对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:11.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}kind of from mini tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从迷你网球就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:15.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've got an older brother, he's five years older than me,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我有个哥哥 比我大五岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:18.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he used to play just for fun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他打球只是为了好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And my parents used to take me up to the club,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N爸妈带我去俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:24.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I used to just sit on the grass and watch him play.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就坐在草地上看他打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:26.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's how it all began.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一切就是这么开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I also just want to still love tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我也想一直热爱网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:33.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't want that feeling of enjoying coming on the court to ever disappear{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不想让上场的快乐消失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:36.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and almost have to feel like a chore.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不想让它变成一份苦差
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.83,TL,,0,0,0,,她个子不高 靠的是脚步和耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:41.15,TL,,0,0,0,,把一个又一个球救回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:42.02,TL,,0,0,0,,她的排名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:44.51,TL,,0,0,0,,也是这么一场一场打上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.42,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.01,TL,,0,0,0,,排名{\fs78}295{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.98,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:53.67,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}27{\fs68}年来 英国女子资格赛球员里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:55.58,TL,,0,0,0,,她是第一个做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:00.26,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 她拿到生涯第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.46,TL,,0,0,0,,最高升到世界第{\fs78}44{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:04.44,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月 背已经开始疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:06.52,TL,,0,0,0,,她还是逆转了凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:09.33,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下凯斯那晚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:11.15,TL,,0,0,0,,她说比赛里背时不时在疼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:12.30,TL,,0,0,0,,可正是这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:14.15,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了她身上的斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:16.33,TL,,0,0,0,,两天后的第四轮 她撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.33,0:02:18.93,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后时退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:20.70,TL,,0,0,0,,背部应力性骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}个大满贯 她错过了{\fs78}3{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:24.89,TL,,0,0,0,,包括家门口的温网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Tennis is all I've known, right?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网球是我唯一熟悉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The past 18 years I've done it every day,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N过去{\fs78}18{\fs68}年我每天都在打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:36.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just not being able to do that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N突然什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:40.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just feeling so like I couldn't do the basic of things.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连最基本的事都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:46.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I couldn't brush my teeth without almost standing back up and just being in agony.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刷牙都得马上直起腰 疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So it was definitely a tough injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这真的是一次难熬的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:53.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's definitely made me a stronger person,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但它让我变得更强大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:54.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a better person,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N变成更好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:56.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and hopefully it'll make me a better tennis player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N希望也让我成为更好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've been kind of good to go really from kind of US Open time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N其实美网时我就能复出了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Decided not to play that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我决定不打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:07.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to almost just put my body under a bit more stress.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让身体再多扛一些强度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:09.40,TL,,0,0,0,,她本可以早点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:12.13,TL,,0,0,0,,可她说 受伤以后听到最好的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:14.12,TL,,0,0,0,,就是别着急 {\fs78}9{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:16.60,TL,,0,0,0,,她在比利 简 金杯总决赛复出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:19.35,TL,,0,0,0,,到了武汉 她先赢卡利尼娜和本西奇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:22.46,TL,,0,0,0,,又只用{\fs78}63{\fs68}分钟 送走了保利尼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And takes it with a thunderous forehand,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一记重炮正手拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and Sonay Kartal continues her comeback{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡尔塔尔继续她的复出之路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:37.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from that stress fracture that saw her miss six months of this season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季她因应力性骨折缺席半年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:42.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Third round in Beijing is now matched with a third round appearance in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N继北京之后 武汉又进第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:48.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's the first Briton ever to make the last four in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首位打进武汉半决赛的英国人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:50.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a story.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多好的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Out for six months this season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季停了六个月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:04:00.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but now getting to the latter stages of the biggest of events.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在却打到了大赛的最后阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.75,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 对手两次发球胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:05.32,TL,,0,0,0,,两次都被她破回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.84,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘都是先落后 再追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:09.67,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘抢七 {\fs78}11{\fs68}比{\fs78}9{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:11.52,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 又是抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.09,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}个盘点 她一个没给
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:20.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was dreaming of playing this match when I was fully fit before the injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N受伤之前 我就梦想打这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:24.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so to be able to come back here in my third event{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N复出第三站就能来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:28.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and to achieve this regardless is a huge milestone for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N做到这一步 对我是一座里程碑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:30.06,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}号的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.37,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是另一场半决赛的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.36,TL,,0,0,0,,打完这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.37,TL,,0,0,0,,她会回到世界前{\fs78}50{\fs68}左右
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:37.27,TL,,0,0,0,,成为新的英国一姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:40.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月前 她疼得连刷牙都难
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.88,TL,,0,0,0,,伤好了 她没有急
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:44.28,TL,,0,0,0,,如果是你 你等得住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:46.72,TL,,0,0,0,,这场决赛 你押她吗？
